Linked from submodules
----------------------

DuckDB
  Copyright (c) 2018-2026 Stichting DuckDB Foundation
  MIT license. Source: duckdb-planner/duckdb-sources (a fork of
  https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb), linked as duckdb_static together with
  its parquet, core_functions and icu extensions.

  DuckDB vendors its own third-party components, which are therefore also
  present in the binary, among them brotli, fast_float, fastpforlib, fmt,
  fsst, httplib, hyperloglog, jaro_winkler, lz4, mbedtls, miniz, pcg,
  pdqsort, re2, skiplist, snappy, snowball, tdigest, thrift, utf8proc,
  yyjson and zstd. Their licenses are in
  duckdb-planner/duckdb-sources/third_party.

  The icu extension embeds International Components for Unicode, which is
  distributed under the Unicode License.

